00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:40.860
<v Sean>Um, there's like a lot of stuff that looks like AI working correctly until you actually try and play it.

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:49.160
<v Mike>And that's if you can, uh, play it, of course, to overcome the crazy, I mean, they just keep finding new ways to impress me, Sean.

